sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Utilisateur
    participant F as Frontend React
    participant SF as Symfony security firewall
    participant UR as UserRepository
    participant PH as Password hasher/verifier
    participant JWT as JWTTokenManagerInterface
    participant CT as CookieTokenManager
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant API as API protegee

    U->>F: Saisit email + mot de passe
    F->>SF: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    SF->>UR: find user by email
    UR->>DB: SELECT users
    DB-->>UR: User
    SF->>PH: Verifie le mot de passe
    alt Identifiants valides
        SF->>JWT: create(User)
        JWT-->>SF: access token JWT
        SF->>CT: issueRefreshToken(User)
        CT->>DB: INSERT refresh_tokens(tokenHash)
        CT-->>SF: refresh token brut
        SF-->>F: 200 + token JSON + cookies HttpOnly
        F->>API: Requete API avec JWT/cookie access_token
        API-->>F: JSON metier
    else Identifiants invalides
        SF-->>F: 401 LoginFailureHandler
    end
    opt Refresh token
        F->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/refresh
        API->>CT: rotateRefreshToken(refresh cookie)
        CT->>DB: Revoque ancien token et cree le nouveau
        API-->>F: Nouveau token + nouveaux cookies
    end
